name: ui-component
description: Generate a Lumina Ledger glassmorphic component
parameters:
  component_type:
    type: string
    description: "e.g., table, modal, card, input, button, sidebar"
instruction: |
  Query MCP tool get_component_snippet for the given component_type or inspect lumina://design/tokens.
  Implement the component using React + Tailwind CSS according to Lumina Ledger rules.
